  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender &amp; Development - Prevention of Sexual and Gender-Based Violence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will prevent gender-based violence in 4 districts, targeting communities by creating Women&#x2019;s Alert Groups, building partnerships with women collectives and government entities. Males, CSOs and service providers will be trained to respect women. This enables coordinated response to gender-based violence. The strategic approach includes capacitated health and legal systems, access to service delivery, GBV screening and support and training and educational measures for women and youth.</narrative>
  </description>
